#. 殺人が起きたと
#. 思われる時間帯は…
msgctxt "0001 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "We've established a timeframe for the murder."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 9>夜１０時<CLT>から…
msgctxt "0002 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"It took place somewhere\n"
"between <CLT 9>10 o'clock at night<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. 朝９時までの間だ。
msgctxt "0003 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "...and 9 o'clock in the morning."
msgstr ""

#. 一方、苗木っちの
#. アリバイがないのが…
msgctxt "0004 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Yup. And Makoto doesn't have\n"
"an alibi for most of that time."
msgstr ""

#. 夜１０時から…
msgctxt "0005 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Yeah, from 10 o'clock..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 9>朝７時３０分<CLT>までの
#. 間だったよね。
msgctxt "0006 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "...<CLT 9>to 7:30<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. それだけの時間があれば
#. 殺人は可能なはず…
msgctxt "0007 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"That's more than enough time\n"
"to commit murder, I should think."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木、何か反論が
#. あるなら言ってみろ…
msgctxt "0008 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"So Makoto, if you have any objections,\n"
"now would be the time..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>苗木のアリバイが無いのは…<CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "<CLT 26>Makoto doesn't have an alibi...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>夜１０時…<CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "<CLT 26>10 o'clock...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>夜１１時…<CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "<CLT 26>11 o'clock...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>深夜１２時…<CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "<CLT 26>12 o'clock...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>深夜１時…<CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "<CLT 26>1 o'clock...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>深夜２時…<CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "<CLT 26>2 o'clock...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>深夜３時…<CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "<CLT 26>3 o'clock...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>深夜４時…<CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "<CLT 26>4 o'clock...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>朝５時…<CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "<CLT 26>5 o'clock...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>朝６時…<CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "<CLT 26>6 o'clock...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>朝７時３０分…<CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "<CLT 26>7:30...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>９時間半もあるじゃない…<CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "<CLT 26>Or 9:30...<CLT>"
msgstr ""
